  [PASS] self-control P2 deep limit nu*sqrt(y) -> 1 1.000000
  [PASS] self-control P2 Newtonian limit nu -> 1 1.000000005
  AGREES P3 "P2 kernel follows from mu = (sqrt(1+4x^2)-1)/(2x); x mu increasing onto (0,oo)": nu = sqrt(y + 1)/sqrt(y)

